    "Lesson 2 from FAILED_CAMPAIGN_META_ANALYSIS_001 \u2014 cost/turnover is the most common cause of failure in the archive \u2014 is corroborated by the real data: every one of CAMPAIGN_010-014 is rejected and every one has either a near-zero or negative per-trade R after costs.",
